3020/ss_fa9302e2c540db602c6553b20c54e4e8fd5fec23.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_e6a7a38fec32b3d3b5ad39e57e7272584cecdcee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771278273","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_e6a7a38fec32b3d3b5ad39e57e7272584cecdcee.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_98d42801fe8fe89bf7864c6c4b224c1d21edf49c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771278273","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_98d42801fe8fe89bf7864c6c4b224c1d21edf49c.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_19d2e61c2d2b0d826c5ae275e601be7cde363cea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771278273","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_19d2e61c2d2b0d826c5ae275e601be7cde363cea.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_45511b53791b1ce423277b107e25dc7e12121a65.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771278273","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_45511b53791b1ce423277b107e25dc7e12121a65.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_b913df61b9275943d280f391cae944b92d64f401.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771278273","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533020/ss_b913df61b9275943d280f391cae944b92d64f401.600x338.jpg?t=1771278273"}],"short_description":"The year is 1510. As wars rage across Europe, Africa, and the Middle East, it is the age of gunpowder and mercenaries - that changed the course of history. You can do it as well, going from a leader of men to the ruler of an empire in this unique mix of RTS and grand strategy.","steam_appid":2533020,"support_info":{"email":"support@indie.io","url":"http://reverieworld.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://reverieworld.com"}